  "notes": {
   "linuxserver": "**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-apprise-api/compare/v2.0.2-ls5...v2.0.2-ls6",
   "upstream": "## What's Changed\r\nA small release to point against the new Apprise v2.1.0 release\r\n\r\n### :bulb: Features\r\n* Accept plain text message bodies and X-Apprise-* headers on notify in https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/pull/377\r\n* reduce restrictions on saving config entries in https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/pull/375\r\n\r\n### :heart: Life-Cycle Support\r\n\r\n* Docker support for AMQP v1.0 and v0.9.1 in https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/pull/379\r\n* docs(i18n): improve and correct Portuguese translations by @ciro-mota in https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/pull/378\r\n* Updated to support terramaster privacy req in https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/pull/380\r\n* Centralize Apprise API version for runtime and package metadata by @brokentokin in https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/pull/376\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @brokentokin made their first contribution in https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/pull/376\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/compare/2.0.1...v2.0.2",
   "upstream_url": "https://github.com/caronc/apprise-api/releases/tag/v2.0.2"
  },
